WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:03.901
-Well, here's a sentence
I never thought I'd say --

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:05.133
Donald Trump was arrested

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:06.834
and appeared
in Manhattan Criminal Court

00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:09.167
to be arraigned on a total
of 34 felony charges.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:11.400
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.934
♪♪

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:16.167
Well, it happened.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:18.033
Trump surrendered
himself to authorities today

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:19.734
and was arraigned at
the Manhattan Criminal Court

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:21.801
on charges stemming from
his hush-money payment

00:00:21.801 --> 00:00:23.367
to adult-film-star
Stormy Daniels

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:25.067
during the 2016 campaign.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:28.334
That's him in court.
Look at his face.

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:29.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.501 --> 00:00:30.968
This is the first time
in his life

00:00:30.968 --> 00:00:32.834
anything's ever dawned on him.

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:34.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:36.767
The day began with tense scenes
in Lower Manhattan

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:38.901
as throngs of Trump supporters
numbering in the tens

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.100
or perhaps even the twelves...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.801
showed up to sort of
just mill around, I guess,

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:45.434
support the former
indicted president,

00:00:45.434 --> 00:00:48.434
where they were outnumbered
by both reporters and pigeons.

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:50.400
Outside,
agitator Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.033
showed up at a nearby park
to scream

00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:53.100
and shout like a lunatic,

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.100
something only a tourist
from Georgia

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.901
would think gets her attention
in New York City.

00:00:57.901 --> 00:00:59.334
New York Congressman
George Santos

00:00:59.334 --> 00:01:00.634
also showed up,
where he claimed

00:01:00.634 --> 00:01:02.701
he was the one who had sex
with Stormy Daniels.

00:01:02.701 --> 00:01:04.000
Then --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.501
Then came Trump Watch.

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:07.734
The media had cameras
trained on him all day

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.434
like a panda cam at a zoo,

00:01:09.434 --> 00:01:11.267
hoping to catch
a panda having sex,

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:13.300
and then illegally funneling
a hush-money payment

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.767
to the panda
they had sex with.

00:01:15.767 --> 00:01:17.234
The cameras even
followed Trump's car

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:20.834
as it drove on the FDR Highway,
a parkway so slow and irritating

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:23.067
that if they really wanted
to name it after a president,

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:25.033
they should name it
after Donald J. Trump.

00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:26.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.767
And then came the moment
when Trump appeared

00:01:27.767 --> 00:01:29.367
at the courthouse
and history was made.

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:31.601
Even Trump himself
seemed shocked.

00:01:31.601 --> 00:01:32.667
-Just minutes ago,

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:35.534
a "where were you when..."
moment.

00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:39.200
Donald Trump
now technically under arrest.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.934
A former candidate who ran
for president amidst crowds

00:01:42.934 --> 00:01:47.501
yelling for the locking up
of his then Democratic opponent,

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:50.634
Hillary Clinton,
has been arrested himself.

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:52.234
He says,
"Heading to lower Manhattan,

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:55.767
the courthouse, seems so
surreal" -- in all caps.

00:01:55.767 --> 00:01:58.400
"Wow.
They are going to arrest me."

00:01:58.400 --> 00:01:59.634
The former president writes,

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:02.701
"Can't believe this is happening
in America. MAGA!"

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:06.634
-Trump commented
on his own arrest,

00:02:06.634 --> 00:02:08.434
a watershed moment
in American history,

00:02:08.434 --> 00:02:10.467
the way your grandpa
posts on Facebook

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:12.601
about his trip to Italy.

00:02:12.601 --> 00:02:14.167
"Wow. Seems so surreal.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:17.334
Can't believe the pizza
is better at home.

00:02:17.334 --> 00:02:18.968
Your grandmother says hello."

00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:20.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:21.534
It's worth stepping back
and appreciating

00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:22.701
just how crazy this was.

00:02:22.701 --> 00:02:24.501
Today, we witnessed
the surreal spectacle

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:26.300
of one of the world's
most notorious figures,

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:28.000
a former president
and current candidate,

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.000
facing arrest and arraignment in
the media capital of the world.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.667
And let's not forget how funny

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:34.601
"current candidate"
is in all this.

00:02:34.601 --> 00:02:36.734
He got arrested, and he's still
running for president.

00:02:36.734 --> 00:02:39.601
This is like Pennywise
doing kids' birthday parties

00:02:39.601 --> 00:02:42.434
after "It" came out.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.434 --> 00:02:45.000
Even before today, the media
speculation was so intense,

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.434
cameras followed his plane's
every movement, from takeoff

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:49.067
in Palm Beach
to landing at LaGuardia.

00:02:49.067 --> 00:02:50.534
Man, look at that.

00:02:50.534 --> 00:02:54.501
The media was tracking him
like he's their GrubHub order.

00:02:54.501 --> 00:02:56.000
"Folks,
we're hearing now that Donald

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.434
is eight minutes away
with our burrito."

00:02:58.434 --> 00:02:59.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:01.901
I didn't think there was
a fate worse than prison,

00:03:01.901 --> 00:03:03.934
but then they made him land
at LaGuardia.

00:03:03.934 --> 00:03:05.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.067 --> 00:03:06.367
"So where are we touching down?

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:08.634
Teterboro? White Plains?"
"LaGuardia, sir."

00:03:08.634 --> 00:03:11.934
"LaGuardia?!
I'm not on trial for murder!"

00:03:11.934 --> 00:03:13.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.367 --> 00:03:15.100
"It's worse than that, sir."
"Spit it out!"

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:17.234
"We're landing
at the Marine terminal."

00:03:17.234 --> 00:03:18.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:21.033
Also, side note --
LaGuardia is nice now.

00:03:21.033 --> 00:03:22.734
They did a great job
with the renovation.

00:03:22.734 --> 00:03:24.701
Unfortunately, it's just
gonna take us a few years

00:03:24.701 --> 00:03:26.067
to stop making
LaGuardia jokes.

00:03:26.067 --> 00:03:28.901
So, LaGuardia, we just ask
for your patience

00:03:28.901 --> 00:03:31.467
in the same way you asked for
ours during what seemed like,

00:03:31.467 --> 00:03:34.167
I don't know, a hundred [bleep]
years of construction.

00:03:34.167 --> 00:03:36.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:40.300
The point is, LaGuardia --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:43.234
LaGuardia is proof that even
the worst parts of New York

00:03:43.234 --> 00:03:45.367
can change...Donald.

00:03:45.367 --> 00:03:46.734
Now...
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.734 --> 00:03:48.300
Nice to know that LaGuardia
is still a very funny

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.167
arrival airport
for a former president.

00:03:50.167 --> 00:03:52.501
Did he also have to wait
for his luggage at the carousel?

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:55.701
I would assume an oversize
gold-plated roller.

00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:58.067
"We got your bag, sir."
"Double check the tag."

00:03:58.067 --> 00:03:59.534
"It's definitely yours, sir."

00:03:59.534 --> 00:04:01.334
"Check the tag!

00:04:01.334 --> 00:04:02.467
They made an announcement.

00:04:02.467 --> 00:04:04.033
A lot of these bags
look the same."

00:04:04.033 --> 00:04:05.067
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.067 --> 00:04:08.267
"I'm gonna follow the rules now!
Okay?

00:04:08.267 --> 00:04:10.567
That's the new Donald."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.567 --> 00:04:13.067
Also, I want to make it clear.
It's not that I'm, like,

00:04:13.067 --> 00:04:15.033
thrilled that a former president
has been indicted.

00:04:15.033 --> 00:04:17.667
I'm not. But I am thrilled
that it's opened a door

00:04:17.667 --> 00:04:19.167
to do topical jokes
about Donald Trump

00:04:19.167 --> 00:04:20.434
flying into LaGuardia.

00:04:20.434 --> 00:04:22.934
I mean, was there a driver
waiting for him there

00:04:22.934 --> 00:04:25.067
with his name misspelled
on a placard?

00:04:25.067 --> 00:04:27.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:28.501
It's one thing to track Trump

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:30.067
as he landed
in New York yesterday

00:04:30.067 --> 00:04:33.067
as he was ushered downtown for
his arraignment this afternoon,

00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:35.601
but why do they watch
his plane take off

00:04:35.601 --> 00:04:37.801
like it was
an Apollo Moon mission?

00:04:37.801 --> 00:04:40.234
Did they think
there was a chance

00:04:40.234 --> 00:04:41.834
he was going to rush
the cockpit,

00:04:41.834 --> 00:04:43.334
grab the controls,
and make a hard

00:04:43.334 --> 00:04:45.601
right turn toward Saudi Arabia?

00:04:45.601 --> 00:04:47.367
"We have breaking news.
Trump has commandeered

00:04:47.367 --> 00:04:49.701
the plane,
and it is now upside down."

00:04:49.701 --> 00:04:51.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.033 --> 00:04:53.567
In fact, cable news
even went so far as to show us

00:04:53.567 --> 00:04:57.067
Trump's luggage coming off the
plane on a conveyor belt Monday.

00:04:57.067 --> 00:04:59.200
-The luggage is starting
to come out from the bottom.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:02.567
So, my -- my guess is that they
don't want to get off the plane

00:05:02.567 --> 00:05:04.234
until the luggage
is in the car,

00:05:04.234 --> 00:05:06.100
so that way they can
just come down the stairs

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.534
and then be ready to go.

00:05:07.534 --> 00:05:09.834
-Or Trump is trying
to smuggle himself

00:05:09.834 --> 00:05:11.501
out inside
one of those suitcases.

00:05:11.501 --> 00:05:13.601
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.601 --> 00:05:15.100
That's why when the luggage
came down,

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:18.400
the carousel kept making
these weird noises.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.400
-Ouch.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:22.267
[ Laughter ]

00:05:23.801 --> 00:05:24.968
Mm.

00:05:24.968 --> 00:05:28.300
[ Laughter continues ]

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.167
It's also the first time
I saw it, you guys,

00:05:30.167 --> 00:05:32.767
and I'm...
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.767 --> 00:05:35.767
Now, when we were at first
speculating about this case,

00:05:35.767 --> 00:05:38.167
I think most people imagined
it would be one or two charges

00:05:38.167 --> 00:05:40.634
of maybe falsifying
business records

00:05:40.634 --> 00:05:42.234
or campaign-finance violations.

00:05:42.234 --> 00:05:45.300
It was then reported
that Trump would face 34 counts.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.200
But even that was unclear
because that could mean,

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.033
say,
one felony and 33 misdemeanors,

00:05:49.033 --> 00:05:51.634
which might actually come off
as a fairly weak case.

00:05:51.634 --> 00:05:53.501
But we found out today
that the charges

00:05:53.501 --> 00:05:55.467
were way more serious than that.

00:05:55.467 --> 00:05:58.067
-NBC News is now reporting
that inside that courtroom,

00:05:58.067 --> 00:05:59.734
Donald Trump pleaded not guilty

00:05:59.734 --> 00:06:03.300
to 34 counts
of falsifying records.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.167
-Our team, Aaron Katersky,

00:06:05.167 --> 00:06:06.734
John Santucci,
Katherine Faulders,

00:06:06.734 --> 00:06:09.300
all joining and reporting
at this hour

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:12.200
that the indictment
is 34 felony counts

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:14.667
of falsifying business records.

00:06:14.667 --> 00:06:17.467
We don't know
if that is all of them,

00:06:17.467 --> 00:06:20.968
but at least 34 felony counts
of falsifying business records.

00:06:20.968 --> 00:06:23.434
-Not just 34 charges,
34 felonies!

00:06:23.434 --> 00:06:24.901
Holy [bleep]
[ Laughter ]

00:06:24.901 --> 00:06:26.434
In order to raise the $130,000

00:06:26.434 --> 00:06:27.767
he used to pay off
Stormy Daniels,

00:06:27.767 --> 00:06:29.934
did he also rob a bank
and a Halloween mask?

00:06:29.934 --> 00:06:30.934
Of course, knowing Trump,

00:06:30.934 --> 00:06:32.334
he'd wear a mask
of his own face,

00:06:32.334 --> 00:06:35.334
although his actual face already
looks like a Halloween mask.

00:06:35.334 --> 00:06:37.534
If you rip that thing off,
you'd probably find

00:06:37.534 --> 00:06:40.501
Patrick Swayze
from "Point Break" under there.

00:06:40.501 --> 00:06:42.000
Must have been a bummer
for Trump's team

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.000
to find out that there were
34 felony charges

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.167
because as recently
as last night, his lawyer,

00:06:46.167 --> 00:06:47.567
a guy named Joe Tacopina,

00:06:47.567 --> 00:06:50.100
was boldly
predicting on Fox News

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:51.734
that the case would
go away quickly.

00:06:51.734 --> 00:06:53.300
-If it gets to a jury.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.667
You know, what I would do,

00:06:54.667 --> 00:06:56.467
what our team would do,
what Todd and Susan would do,

00:06:56.467 --> 00:06:59.067
is simply look, you know,
the jurors in the eyes and say,

00:06:59.067 --> 00:07:00.901
"This is -- You understand
you're not voting

00:07:00.901 --> 00:07:02.501
for a political office here.

00:07:02.501 --> 00:07:04.868
This is not
a presidential campaign

00:07:04.868 --> 00:07:06.701
or a gubernatorial campaign.

00:07:06.701 --> 00:07:08.167
This is someone's
life and liberty."

00:07:08.167 --> 00:07:10.567
This should be the quickest
verdict in the history

00:07:10.567 --> 00:07:12.167
of the United States of America.

00:07:12.167 --> 00:07:13.467
-First of all,
life and liberty

00:07:13.467 --> 00:07:15.501
also sound like porn stars
he paid hush money to.

00:07:15.501 --> 00:07:17.000
[ Laughter ]

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.868
"Stormy introduced me
to Liberty,

00:07:18.868 --> 00:07:20.334
who introduced me to Chastity.

00:07:20.334 --> 00:07:22.701
And next thing you know,
bing, bang, boom, 34 felonies."

00:07:22.701 --> 00:07:24.200
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:26.234
Also, I almost feel bad
for Rudy Giuliani

00:07:26.234 --> 00:07:28.868
having to watch this guy.
That used to be Rudy's job.

00:07:28.868 --> 00:07:30.100
"Yeah, he's pretty good,
I guess,

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.567
if you like tall and handsome.

00:07:31.567 --> 00:07:34.000
You know, I used to be tall,
but then my limo hit a pothole

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.868
and my neck fell down
inside my chest."

00:07:35.868 --> 00:07:37.067
[ Laughter ]

00:07:37.067 --> 00:07:39.033
"It was on the DJT."

00:07:39.033 --> 00:07:41.033
[ Laughter ]

00:07:41.033 --> 00:07:43.267
We saw something historic today,
and in many ways,

00:07:43.267 --> 00:07:46.234
it was healthy to see business
unfolding as normal in New York

00:07:46.234 --> 00:07:48.234
because this is how
a healthy democracy

00:07:48.234 --> 00:07:50.634
and criminal justice system
should be functioning.

00:07:50.634 --> 00:07:52.434
Donald Trump
will be presumed innocent,

00:07:52.434 --> 00:07:54.200
as all criminal defendants are,

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.968
and the prosecution will have
to prove that Trump

00:07:55.968 --> 00:07:57.434
paid off Stormy as well as...

00:07:57.434 --> 00:07:58.467
-Life and liberty.

00:07:58.467 --> 00:08:00.334
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:08:00.334 --> 00:08:02.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:02.334 --> 00:08:04.133
♪♪

